{{#is_alert}}
## What's happening?

Kueue has churned through {{value}} preempted/evicted workloads in the last 5 minutes, above the critical threshold of {{threshold}}. This pattern indicates preemption/eviction thrashing rather than a single expected preemption event.

This monitor covers all ClusterQueues together. To identify which queue is responsible, break down `kueue.evicted_workloads.count` by `kueue_cluster_queue` and `kueue.preempted_workloads.count` by `preempting_cluster_queue`.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
## What's happening?

Kueue has churned through {{value}} preempted/evicted workloads in the last 5 minutes, above the warning threshold of {{warn_threshold}}.
{{/is_warning}}

{{#is_recovery}}
## Recovered

Preemption/eviction churn has resolved. Current value: {{value}}.
{{/is_recovery}}
